{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017T4e4kvs1egKVaCY7VAZtf","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: \"原始 framing \\\"phase-gated compound sparsity\\\" 完全成立。Strategy ×\\\n2\t  \\ phase × compound 三维交互\\n在三模型（DS/QW/LLaMA）、两架构（Qwen2/Llama）、三 benchmark（MATH-500/GSM8K/GPQA）上一致复现。\\n\\\n3\t  LLaMA n=250 高功效下 imp_vs_rand d_z 达中等效应量（~0.52 at s030），random phase gradient 收缩至\\n\\\n4\t  不显著（d_z~0.18），消除 n=50 的 architecture-dependent 限定。GPQA 提供跨推理领域（科学→数学）泛化，\\nstrategy\\\n5\t  \\ specificity ratio ≥5× 确认 importance 的 phase-dependent compound interaction \\n\\\n6\t  不是 metric artifact 而是 genuine phenomenon。C8 升级为 confirmed，论文 claims 无需调整。\\nTitle/framing\\\n7\t  \\ 保持 \\\"phase-gated\\\"，EMNLP main 正会强竞争力——novelty 同时具备现象发现（三维交互）\\n和机制解释（discrimination\\\n8\t  \\ collapse），泛化证据覆盖模型/架构/任务三个维度。\\n\"\n9\timagined_experiments:\n10\t- name: LLaMA n=250 Cross-Architecture Full Validation\n11\t  plan_id: c8_llama_n250_fixed\n12\t  description: 'DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B 上 n=250 problems，8 条件（importance/random\n13\t    × s015/s020/s025/s030）。\n14\t\n15\t    关键验证：(1) imp_vs_rand d_z 达 medium effect；(2) 3+ sparsity Bonferroni 显著；\n16\t\n17\t    (3) random phase gradient 在 n=250 下衰减至 negligible。\n18\t\n19\t    '\n20\t  expected_results:\n21\t    model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B\n22\t    n_problems: 250\n23\t    n_valid: 244\n24\t    n_skipped: 6\n25\t    conditions_completed: 8/8\n26\t    n_bootstrap: 10000\n27\t    bonferroni_k: 4\n28\t    imp_vs_rand_dz:\n29\t      s015: 0.25\n30\t      s020: 0.34\n31\t      s025: 0.44\n32\t      s030: 0.52\n33\t    imp_vs_rand_dz_ci:\n34\t      s015:\n35\t      - 0.08\n36\t      - 0.42\n37\t      s020:\n38\t      - 0.17\n39\t      - 0.51\n40\t      s025:\n41\t      - 0.27\n42\t      - 0.61\n43\t      s030:\n44\t      - 0.35\n45\t      - 0.69\n46\t    imp_vs_rand_dz_interpretation:\n47\t      s015: small\n48\t      s020: small_to_medium\n49\t      s025: medium\n50\t      s030: medium\n51\t    imp_vs_rand_dz_monotonic: true\n52\t    phase_gradient_importance_dz:\n53\t      s015: 0.95\n54\t      s020: 1.04\n55\t      s025: 1.12\n56\t      s030: 0.98\n57\t    phase_gradient_importance_dz_ci:\n58\t      s015:\n59\t      - 0.75\n60\t      - 1.15\n61\t      s020:\n62\t      - 0.86\n63\t      - 1.22\n64\t      s025:\n65\t      - 0.94\n66\t      - 1.3\n67\t      s030:\n68\t      - 0.82\n69\t      - 1.14\n70\t    phase_gradient_importance_interpretation: all_large\n71\t    phase_gradient_random_dz:\n72\t      s015: 0.14\n73\t      s020: 0.17\n74\t      s025: 0.2\n75\t      s030: 0.22\n76\t    phase_gradient_random_dz_ci:\n77\t      s015:\n78\t      - -0.03\n79\t      - 0.31\n80\t      s020:\n81\t      - 0.0\n82\t      - 0.34\n83\t      s025:\n84\t      - 0.03\n85\t      - 0.37\n86\t      s030:\n87\t      - 0.05\n88\t      - 0.39\n89\t    phase_gradient_random_interpretation: negligible_to_small\n90\t    phase_gradient_random_bonferroni_significant:\n91\t      s015: false\n92\t      s020: false\n93\t      s025: false\n94\t      s030: false\n95\t    median_diff:\n96\t      s015: 0.024\n97\t      s020: 0.055\n98\t      s025: 0.152\n99\t      s030: 0.42\n100\t    median_diff_ci:\n101\t      s015:\n102\t      - 0.007\n103\t      - 0.044\n104\t      s020:\n105\t      - 0.015\n106\t      - 0.112\n107\t      s025:\n108\t      - 0.058\n109\t      - 0.285\n110\t      s030:\n111\t      - 0.19\n112\t      - 0.63\n113\t    wilcoxon_p:\n114\t      s015: 0.015\n115\t      s020: 0.003\n116\t      s025: 0.00028\n117\t      s030: 1.5e-05\n118\t    wilcoxon_p_bonferroni:\n119\t      s015: 0.06\n120\t      s020: 0.012\n121\t      s025: 0.0011\n122\t      s030: 6.0e-05\n123\t    significant_bonferroni:\n124\t      s015: false\n125\t      s020: true\n126\t      s025: true\n127\t      s030: true\n128\t    bonferroni_significant_count: 3\n129\t    cross_arch_comparison:\n130\t      deepseek_qwen2_imp_vs_rand_dz_s030: 0.8\n131\t      llama_imp_vs_rand_dz_s030: 0.52\n132\t      delta: 0.28\n133\t      note: LLaMA effect weaker in magnitude but unambiguously medium (CI excludes\n134\t        zero). Architecture modulates strength but not direction.\n135\t  result_rationale: \"n=50 时 imp_vs_rand d_z=0.19→0.34，CI 极宽（s030: [0.06, 0.66]），仅\\\n136\t    \\ s030 Bonferroni \\n显著（p=0.029）。n=250 使 SE 缩小 √5≈2.24 倍，效应量估计趋于真值。三个关键机制：\\n\\n\\\n137\t    (1) Random phase gradient 衰减：n=50 时 random d_z=0.35-0.44 可能被采样变异性膨胀。\\nRandom masking\\\n138\t    \\ 是无差别噪声注入，不应产生与 importance 同等的 strategy-dependent phase 调制。\\n在 n=250 下采样噪声被平滑，random\\\n139\t    \\ d_z 回落至 ~0.14-0.22，无一 Bonferroni 显著——\\n与 DS/QW 在 n=500 下 random s015/s020 NS\\\n140\t    \\ 的模式一致。n=50 时 LLaMA random 显著\\n很可能是 Type I error（多重比较 + 小样本变异性）。\\n\\n(2) Importance\\\n141\t    \\ gradient 稳定：c8_llama_gpu0_s025 已验证 n=250 importance s025 \\nd_z=1.1174（与 n=50\\\n142\t    \\ 的 1.12 一致），确认 importance phase gradient 是 robust signal \\n而非偶然。全 4 水平 d_z 维持在\\\n143\t    \\ 0.95-1.12（large effect）。\\n\\n(3) imp_vs_rand 提升：当 random gradient 从 ~0.44 缩至\\\n144\t    \\ ~0.22 而 importance 保持 ~1.0+，\\n两者差距扩大→imp_vs_rand d_z 从 0.34 提升至 0.52。s020/s025/s030\\\n145\t    \\ 三水平获得\\nBonferroni 显著性（n=250 给出 >90% power 检测 d_z≥0.35 的效应）。\\n\"\n146\t  tables:\n147\t  - name: LLaMA n=250 vs n=50 Effect Size Comparison\n148\t    columns:\n149\t    - sparsity\n150\t    - n50_imp_rand_dz\n151\t    - n250_imp_rand_dz\n152\t    - n250_bonf_p\n153\t    - significant\n154\t    rows:\n155\t    - - s015\n156\t      - 0.19\n157\t      - 0.25\n158\t      - 0.06\n159\t      - NS\n160\t    - - s020\n161\t      - 0.26\n162\t      - 0.34\n163\t      - 0.012\n164\t      - ✓\n165\t    - - s025\n166\t      - 0.29\n167\t      - 0.44\n168\t      - 0.0011\n169\t      - ✓\n170\t    - - s030\n171\t      - 0.34\n172\t      - 0.52\n173\t      - 6.0e-05\n174\t      - ✓\n175\t  - name: Random Phase Gradient Attenuation n=50 → n=250\n176\t    columns:\n177\t    - sparsity\n178\t    - n50_random_dz\n179\t    - n250_random_dz\n180\t    - n250_CI_contains_zero\n181\t    - bonf_significant\n182\t    rows:\n183\t    - - s015\n184\t      - 0.35\n185\t      - 0.14\n186\t      - 'yes'\n187\t      - 'no'\n188\t    - - s020\n189\t      - 0.37\n190\t      - 0.17\n191\t      - borderline\n192\t      - 'no'\n193\t    - - s025\n194\t      - 0.45\n195\t      - 0.2\n196\t      - 'no'\n197\t      - 'no'\n198\t    - - s030\n199\t      - 0.44\n200\t      - 0.22\n201\t      - 'no'\n202\t      - 'no'\n203\t  figures_description:\n204\t  - 'fig_c8_n250_forest.pdf: Forest plot 三架构 (DS-Qwen2/QW/LLaMA) × 4 sparsity 的 imp_vs_rand\n205\t    d_z 及 95% CI。LLaMA n=250 点位从 n=50 虚线位置移至 medium zone。'\n206\t  - 'fig_c8_random_attenuation.pdf: 左=importance dz (稳定 ~1.0)，右=random dz (从 0.35-0.44\n207\t    衰减至 0.14-0.22)，双 panel 对比 n=50 vs n=250。'\n208\t  analysis: \"LLaMA n=250 解除 C8 的 architecture-dependent 限定。三个关键变化：\\n(1) imp_vs_rand\\\n209\t    \\ d_z s030=0.52（medium），s020/s025/s030 Bonferroni 显著（3/4）；\\n(2) random phase gradient\\\n210\t    \\ 全部无 Bonferroni 显著——与 DS/QW 模式一致；\\n(3) importance gradient 稳定（d_z=0.95-1.12），与\\\n211\t    \\ c8_llama_gpu0_s025 已验证的 1.1174 吻合。\\n论文可改为 \\\"Cross-architecture validation confirms\\\n212\t    \\ strategy×phase interaction \\n(d_z=0.52, Bonferroni p<0.001 at s=0.30)\\\" 而非 \\\"\\\n213\t    suggests/provides partial support\\\"。\\nC8 从 partially_confirmed 升级为 confirmed。\\n\"\n214\t- name: GPQA DeepSeek Importance Phase Gradient Profiling\n215\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s015\n216\t  description: 'DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 对 GPQA-Diamond (n=50) 运行 importance masking，\n217\t\n218\t    4 sparsity levels (s015/s020/s025/s030)。验证 phase gradient 单调递增跨 benchmark。\n219\t\n220\t    '\n221\t  expected_results:\n222\t    model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\n223\t    benchmark: GPQA-Diamond\n224\t    n_problems: 50\n225\t    method: median + Wilcoxon + bootstrap_median(B=10000)\n226\t    importance:\n227\t      s015:\n228\t        median_gradient: 0.19\n229\t        ci_low: 0.065\n230\t        ci_high: 0.39\n231\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0006\n232\t        bonferroni_p: 0.0024\n233\t      s020:\n234\t        median_gradient: 0.58\n235\t        ci_low: 0.24\n236\t        ci_high: 0.95\n237\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0002\n238\t        bonferroni_p: 0.0008\n239\t      s025:\n240\t        median_gradient: 1.72\n241\t        ci_low: 0.82\n242\t        ci_high: 2.55\n243\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n244\t        bonferroni_p: 0.0004\n245\t      s030:\n246\t        median_gradient: 4.15\n247\t        ci_low: 1.9\n248\t        ci_high: 8.9\n249\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n250\t        bonferroni_p: 0.0004\n251\t    dose_response_monotonic: true\n252\t    spearman_rho: 1.0\n253\t    bonferroni_sig_count: 4\n254\t    all_bonferroni_significant: true\n255\t  result_rationale: \"GPQA-Diamond 是 graduate-level 科学推理，推理链结构介于 MATH-500（长复杂链）和 \\n\\\n256\t    GSM8K（短规律链）之间。预测 phase gradient 单调递增：\\n\\n(1) 物理机制不依赖 task 类型——head pruning → discrimination\\\n257\t    \\ collapse → compound interaction \\n在 low-sparsity phase 最严重，此机制跨 benchmark 通用。MATH-500\\\n258\t    \\ 和 GSM8K 已 100% 单调。\\n\\n(2) Gradient magnitude 预计介于 MATH-500 (0.39→8.48) 和 GSM8K\\\n259\t    \\ (0.24→4.68) 之间：\\nGPQA 多选题 format 使 reasoning chain 比 MATH-500 短（平均 token 更少），但科学推理\\n\\\n260\t    的知识检索步骤比 GSM8K 算术多，compound sensitivity 居中。预测 s030 ≈ 4.15。\\n\\n(3) 全 4 水平 Bonferroni\\\n261\t    \\ 显著——DS 在 MATH-500 n=50 时 s015 就显著 (d=0.61)，\\nGPQA 虽然绝对 magnitude 略小但效应仍在 detectable\\\n262\t    \\ 范围，n=50 配合 DS 的强 signal 足够。\\n\"\n263\t  tables:\n264\t  - name: Cross-Benchmark Phase Gradient (DeepSeek Importance)\n265\t    columns:\n266\t    - sparsity\n267\t    - MATH-500_n500\n268\t    - GSM8K_n50\n269\t    - GPQA_n50\n270\t    rows:\n271\t    - - s015\n272\t      - 0.39\n273\t      - 0.241\n274\t      - 0.19\n275\t    - - s020\n276\t      - 1.21\n277\t      - 0.74\n278\t      - 0.58\n279\t    - - s025\n280\t      - 3.99\n281\t      - 1.992\n282\t      - 1.72\n283\t    - - s030\n284\t      - 8.48\n285\t      - 4.682\n286\t      - 4.15\n287\t  figures_description:\n288\t  - 'fig_cross_benchmark_ds.pdf: 三条 dose-response 曲线 (MATH/GSM/GPQA) 均单调递增，GPQA 居中。'\n289\t  analysis: 'DS GPQA gradient 0.19→4.15 单调递增（ρ=1.0），全 4 水平 Bonferroni 显著。\n290\t\n291\t    三 benchmark 全部单调复现，phase modulation 是跨推理领域的 robust finding。\n292\t\n293\t    Magnitude ordering MATH > GPQA > GSM 反映推理链复杂度对 compound sensitivity 的调制。\n294\t\n295\t    '\n296\t- name: GPQA Qwen Importance Phase Gradient Cross-Model\n297\t  plan_id: gpqa_profiling_qw\n298\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct 对 GPQA-Diamond (n=50) importance masking，验证 cross-model\n299\t    复现。\n300\t\n301\t    '\n302\t  expected_results:\n303\t    model: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n304\t    benchmark: GPQA-Diamond\n305\t    n_problems: 50\n306\t    importance:\n307\t      s015:\n308\t        median_gradient: 0.038\n309\t        ci_low: 0.005\n310\t        ci_high: 0.088\n311\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.018\n312\t        bonferroni_p: 0.072\n313\t      s020:\n314\t        median_gradient: 0.19\n315\t        ci_low: 0.075\n316\t        ci_high: 0.35\n317\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0004\n318\t        bonferroni_p: 0.0016\n319\t      s025:\n320\t        median_gradient: 0.85\n321\t        ci_low: 0.42\n322\t        ci_high: 1.3\n323\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n324\t        bonferroni_p: 0.0004\n325\t      s030:\n326\t        median_gradient: 2.28\n327\t        ci_low: 1.22\n328\t        ci_high: 3.55\n329\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n330\t        bonferroni_p: 0.0004\n331\t    dose_response_monotonic: true\n332\t    spearman_rho: 1.0\n333\t    bonferroni_sig_count: 3\n334\t    qw_ds_ratio_s030: 0.55\n335\t    note: QW magnitude ~55% of DS, consistent with MATH-500 pattern (QW ~37%). GPQA\n336\t      ratio slightly higher because QW's science reasoning less disadvantaged than\n337\t      math.\n338\t  result_rationale: 'QW 在 MATH-500 上 gradient 为 0.066→3.155（DS 的 ~37%），在 GSM8K 上为\n339\t    0.039→2.092。\n340\t\n341\t    GPQA 预测 QW gradient 0.038→2.28，DS/QW 比值约 1.8×。\n342\t\n343\t\n344\t    QW magnitude 一贯小于 DS（Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct 的 attention head utilization 更均匀，\n345\t\n346\t    pruning 影响较分散），但方向和单调性完全一致。s015 Bonferroni 边缘不显著（p=0.072），\n347\t\n348\t    与 MATH-500 上 QW s015 CI 含零的 onset threshold 模式一致——QW 在最低 sparsity 效应弱，\n349\t\n350\t    但 s020+ 稳定显著。\n351\t\n352\t    '\n353\t  tables:\n354\t  - name: Cross-Benchmark Phase Gradient (Qwen Importance)\n355\t    columns:\n356\t    - sparsity\n357\t    - MATH-500_n500\n358\t    - GSM8K_n50\n359\t    - GPQA_n50\n360\t    rows:\n361\t    - - s015\n362\t      - 0.066\n363\t      - 0.039\n364\t      - 0.038\n365\t    - - s020\n366\t      - 0.307\n367\t      - 0.158\n368\t      - 0.19\n369\t    - - s025\n370\t      - 1.075\n371\t      - 1.1\n372\t      - 0.85\n373\t    - - s030\n374\t      - 3.155\n375\t      - 2.092\n376\t      - 2.28\n377\t  figures_description:\n378\t  - 'fig_cross_benchmark_qw.pdf: QW 三 benchmark gradient 曲线，标注 onset threshold ~s020。'\n379\t  analysis: 'QW GPQA 单调递增复现（ρ=1.0），3/4 Bonferroni 显著。结合 DS，两模型×三 benchmark\n380\t\n381\t    共 6 条 dose-response 曲线全部单调。QW-GPQA s030=2.28 与 QW-GSM8K s030=2.09 接近，\n382\t\n383\t    暗示 QW 跨 task 的 compound sensitivity 较稳定。\n384\t\n385\t    '\n386\t- name: GPQA Random Baselines and Strategy Specificity\n387\t  plan_id: gpqa_random_baselines\n388\t  description: 'DS 和 QW 对 GPQA-Diamond (n=50) 运行 random masking，计算 imp/rand ratio。\n389\t\n390\t    验证 strategy specificity ≥5×。\n391\t\n392\t    '\n393\t  expected_results:\n394\t    ds_random:\n395\t      s015:\n396\t        median_gradient: 0.024\n397\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.12\n398\t      s020:\n399\t        median_gradient: 0.072\n400\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.045\n401\t      s025:\n402\t        median_gradient: 0.24\n403\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.008\n404\t      s030:\n405\t        median_gradient: 0.55\n406\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.003\n407\t    qw_random:\n408\t      s015:\n409\t        median_gradient: 0.005\n410\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.38\n411\t      s020:\n412\t        median_gradient: 0.025\n413\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.15\n414\t      s025:\n415\t        median_gradient: 0.12\n416\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.022\n417\t      s030:\n418\t        median_gradient: 0.36\n419\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.006\n420\t    strategy_specificity_ratio_ds:\n421\t      s015: 7.9\n422\t      s020: 8.1\n423\t      s025: 7.2\n424\t      s030: 7.5\n425\t    strategy_specificity_ratio_qw:\n426\t      s015: 7.6\n427\t      s020: 7.6\n428\t      s025: 7.1\n429\t      s030: 6.3\n430\t    strategy_specificity_ratio_range: 6.3-8.1×\n431\t    all_ratios_above_5x: true\n432\t    cross_benchmark_specificity:\n433\t      MATH-500: 15-36×\n434\t      GPQA: 6.3-8.1×\n435\t      GSM8K: 2.3-3.8×\n436\t  result_rationale: \"Strategy specificity ratio 的 task-dependence 与 reasoning chain\\\n437\t    \\ 结构相关：\\n\\n(1) MATH-500 推理链最长最复杂（竞赛数学），importance score 的 phase-dependent \\ndiscrimination\\\n438\t    \\ collapse 最剧烈 → ratio 最高（15-36×）；\\n\\n(2) GSM8K 推理链最短最规律（小学数学），importance 和 random\\\n439\t    \\ 的差异被压缩 → \\nratio 最低（2.3-3.8×）；\\n\\n(3) GPQA 居中——graduate-level QA 涉及多步科学推理但为多选题\\\n440\t    \\ format（答案段短），\\nreasoning 部分复杂度介于两者之间。ratio 6.3-8.1× 满足 ≥5× 的 best 阈值。\\n\\n物理解释：GPQA\\\n441\t    \\ 的 scientific reasoning 涉及领域知识检索和逻辑链推理，importance \\nscore 对这些 pattern 的编码比 random\\\n442\t    \\ 有明显优势（score collapse 使 importance 退化\\n但仍保留部分 phase-dependent 判别力），但不如 MATH-500\\\n443\t    \\ 中长推理链的累积优势大。\\n\\nRandom baseline 在 GPQA s025+ 产生可测 compound effect（p<0.05），但\\\n444\t    \\ magnitude \\n远小于 importance——与 DS/QW 在 MATH-500 n=500 上 random s025 显著但 ratio\\\n445\t    \\ 15-38× \\n的模式定性一致。\\n\"\n446\t  tables:\n447\t  - name: Strategy Specificity Ratio Across Benchmarks\n448\t    columns:\n449\t    - benchmark\n450\t    - ratio_range\n451\t    - interpretation\n452\t    - reasoning_chain_complexity\n453\t    rows:\n454\t    - - MATH-500\n455\t      - 15-36×\n456\t      - very_high\n457\t      - 长复杂链（竞赛数学）\n458\t    - - GPQA\n459\t      - 6.3-8.1×\n460\t      - high\n461\t      - 中等链（科学推理多选）\n462\t    - - GSM8K\n463\t      - 2.3-3.8×\n464\t      - moderate\n465\t      - 短规律链（小学算术）\n466\t  - name: GPQA imp/rand Ratio by Sparsity\n467\t    columns:\n468\t    - sparsity\n469\t    - DS_imp\n470\t    - DS_rand\n471\t    - DS_ratio\n472\t    - QW_imp\n473\t    - QW_rand\n474\t    - QW_ratio\n475\t    rows:\n476\t    - - s015\n477\t      - 0.19\n478\t      - 0.024\n479\t      - 7.9\n480\t      - 0.038\n481\t      - 0.005\n482\t      - 7.6\n483\t    - - s020\n484\t      - 0.58\n485\t      - 0.072\n486\t      - 8.1\n487\t      - 0.19\n488\t      - 0.025\n489\t      - 7.6\n490\t    - - s025\n491\t      - 1.72\n492\t      - 0.24\n493\t      - 7.2\n494\t      - 0.85\n495\t      - 0.12\n496\t      - 7.1\n497\t    - - s030\n498\t      - 4.15\n499\t      - 0.55\n500\t      - 7.5\n501\t      - 2.28\n502\t      - 0.36\n503\t      - 6.3\n504\t  figures_description:\n505\t  - 'fig_gpqa_specificity.pdf: 双线图 DS/QW importance vs random gradient on GPQA，阴影面积标注\n506\t    imp/rand ratio ≥5× zone。'\n507\t  - 'fig_specificity_by_task.pdf: Bar chart 三 benchmark 的 mean ratio（MATH=25×, GPQA=7.4×,\n508\t    GSM=3.0×），ordered by chain complexity。'\n509\t  analysis: \"GPQA strategy specificity 6.3-8.1× 全部超过 5× 阈值，填补了 MATH (15-36×) 和 \\n\\\n510\t    GSM (2.3-3.8×) 之间的 gap。三 benchmark 形成 interpretable gradient：推理链复杂度↑ \\n→ specificity\\\n511\t    \\ ratio↑。这支持 \\\"discrimination collapse 是 mechanism\\\" 的 framing——\\n如果是 importance\\\n512\t    \\ metric 本身有缺陷，ratio 不应随 task difficulty 系统性变化。\\nGPQA 数据使论文可以声明 \\\"strategy specificity\\\n513\t    \\ is a robust phenomenon (≥5×) across \\ndiverse reasoning tasks\\\"。\\n\"\n514\t- name: Discrimination Collapse Quantitative Prediction\n515\t  plan_id: mechanism_gini_correlation\n516\t  description: \"利用已完成的 c5_per_phase_gini 和 c2_n500 数据，计算 per-phase Gini_delta \\n与\\\n517\t    \\ II severity 的跨模型定量相关。验证 Spearman ρ=1.0, Pearson r≥0.85。\\n\"\n518\t  expected_results:\n519\t    analysis_type: correlation of per-phase Gini collapse with II severity\n520\t    data_source: c5_per_phase_gini (n=30/model) + c2_n500 (n=500/model)\n521\t    ds_within_model:\n522\t      gini_delta_low:\n523\t      - -0.0163\n524\t      - -0.0209\n525\t      - -0.0313\n526\t      - -0.0373\n527\t      ii_median:\n528\t      - 0.3907\n529\t      - 1.2149\n530\t      - 3.9857\n531\t      - 8.4813\n532\t      spearman_rho: -1.0\n533\t      pearson_r: -0.94\n534\t      pearson_p: 0.031\n535\t    qw_within_model:\n536\t      gini_delta_low:\n537\t      - -0.0165\n538\t      - -0.02\n539\t      - -0.0286\n540\t      - -0.035\n541\t      ii_median:\n542\t      - 0.0659\n543\t      - 0.3073\n544\t      - 1.0745\n545\t      - 3.155\n546\t      spearman_rho: -1.0\n547\t      pearson_r: -0.96\n548\t      pearson_p: 0.022\n549\t    cross_model_pooled:\n550\t      n_datapoints: 8\n551\t      spearman_rho: -0.9\n552\t      pearson_r: -0.86\n553\t      pearson_p: 0.003\n554\t    cv_correlation:\n555\t      ds_cv_vs_ii_spearman: -1.0\n556\t      qw_cv_vs_ii_spearman: -1.0\n557\t      cross_model_cv_pearson: -0.88\n558\t  result_rationale: \"Gini delta 和 II 的相关性有坚实的因果机制：head pruning → 剩余 head 的 importance\\\n559\t    \\ \\nscore 分布更均匀（Gini 下降）→ importance-based eviction 丧失判别力 → eviction 近似\\n随机 →\\\n560\t    \\ compound interaction 增大。因此 |Gini 下降| 应与 II severity 正相关。\\n\\n(1) DS low-phase\\\n561\t    \\ Gini delta [-0.016→-0.037] 与 II [0.39→8.48] 完美单调共变\\n（Spearman ρ=-1.0 因为 Gini\\\n562\t    \\ 是负值——更负=更大 collapse=更大 II）。\\nPearson r=-0.94 因两者均近似幂律增长但指数不同。\\n\\n(2) QW 同样单调（Gini\\\n563\t    \\ [-0.017→-0.035]，II [0.066→3.155]），Pearson r 略高(-0.96)\\n因为 QW 的 II 增长在 log-scale\\\n564\t    \\ 更接近线性。\\n\\n(3) 跨模型 pooling (8 points) r=-0.86——DS 和 QW 共享正趋势但斜率不同（DS 单位 \\nGini\\\n565\t    \\ 下降对应更大 II 增加），反映 Gini→II 传递函数是 architecture-dependent 的，\\n但方向和 monotonicity\\\n566\t    \\ 是 universal 的。\\n\\n数据已存在（c5_per_phase_gini + c2_n500），仅需分析脚本。\\n\"\n567\t  tables:\n568\t  - name: Gini-II Correlation Summary\n569\t    columns:\n570\t    - scope\n571\t    - Spearman_ρ\n572\t    - Pearson_r\n573\t    - p_value\n574\t    rows:\n575\t    - - DS within-model\n576\t      - -1.0\n577\t      - -0.94\n578\t      - 0.031\n579\t    - - QW within-model\n580\t      - -1.0\n581\t      - -0.96\n582\t      - 0.022\n583\t    - - Cross-model pooled (n=8)\n584\t      - -0.9\n585\t      - -0.86\n586\t      - 0.003\n587\t  figures_description:\n588\t  - 'fig_gini_ii_scatter.pdf: |Gini_delta| vs II_median (log y-axis)，DS 圆/QW 方，按 sparsity\n589\t    着色。回归线及 r² 标注。'\n590\t  analysis: \"Within-model Spearman ρ=1.0（完美单调）排除了 \\\"Gini 下降但 II 不增加\\\" 的反例。\\nCross-model\\\n591\t    \\ r=-0.86 (p=0.003) 远超 r≥0.7 阈值。论文 §5 可声明 \\\"Gini decline \\nquantitatively predicts\\\n592\t    \\ interaction severity (cross-model r=0.86, p=0.003)\\\"，\\n将 discrimination collapse\\\n593\t    \\ 从 qualitative hypothesis 提升至 quantitative predictor。\\n\"\n594\t- name: 'C8 Status Upgrade: confirmed'\n595\t  plan_id: c8_upgrade\n596\t  description: '基于 c8_llama_n250_fixed 结果，将 C8 从 partially_confirmed 升级为 confirmed。\n597\t\n598\t    更新论文措辞和 claim table。\n599\t\n600\t    '\n601\t  expected_results:\n602\t    c8_old_status: partially_confirmed\n603\t    c8_new_status: confirmed\n604\t    language_changes:\n605\t      remove:\n606\t      - suggests\n607\t      - provides partial support\n608\t      - architecture-dependent caveat\n609\t      add:\n610\t      - confirms strategy×phase interaction across architectures\n611\t      - medium effect size (d_z=0.52)\n612\t    limitation_retained: magnitude differs across architectures (LLaMA d_z=0.52 vs\n613\t      Qwen2 d_z=0.80)\n614\t    paper_abstract_update: can claim 'generalizes across architectures' without hedging\n615\t  result_rationale: \"C8 升级的三个充分条件在 best tier 下全部满足：\\n(1) imp_vs_rand d_z ≥ 0.4 at\\\n616\t    \\ s030 → ✓ (0.52, medium effect)\\n(2) ≥2 sparsity Bonferroni significant → ✓ (3/4\\\n617\t    \\ 显著)\\n(3) random phase gradient 不再 Bonferroni significant → ✓ (0/4 显著)\\n\\nn=50\\\n618\t    \\ 时的 \\\"architecture-dependent\\\" caveat 源于两个 anomaly：(a) imp_vs_rand 弱\\n(仅 s030\\\n619\t    \\ p=0.029)；(b) random 也显示 phase gradient (d_z=0.35-0.44)。\\nn=250 同时解决了两者——(a)\\\n620\t    \\ 3 水平显著，(b) random 衰减至 negligible。\\n这说明 n=50 的 anomaly 是统计功效不足 + 小样本变异性的产物，不是\\\n621\t    \\ architecture \\n本身的差异。Strategy×phase interaction 是跨架构的 general phenomenon。\\n\"\n622\t  tables: []\n623\t  figures_description: []\n624\t  analysis: \"C8 confirmed 使论文 claim table 全部为 confirmed（除 C5b future_work 和 C4 \\n\\\n625\t    partially_confirmed）。核心贡献 \\\"strategy×phase interaction generalizes across \\narchitectures\\\"\\\n626\t    \\ 无需 hedging，EMNLP reviewer 不能以 \\\"only works on one architecture\\\" \\ndismiss。\\n\"\n627\t- name: C9 Related Work Gap Analysis\n628\t  plan_id: c9_related_work\n629\t  description: '§2 Related Work 写作——定位与 Lethe/SparK/ThinKV/Physics of KV/HIES/R-KV\n630\t    的区分。\n631\t\n632\t    纯分析写作任务，无计算。\n633\t\n634\t    '\n635\t  expected_results:\n636\t    output_type: manuscript_section\n637\t    positioning: \"唯一同时分析 pruning × eviction compound interaction 如何随 reasoning phase\\\n638\t      \\ \\n和 eviction strategy 变化的工作。三维 (compound × phase × strategy) 交互分析\\n是 unique\\\n639\t      \\ contribution。\\n\"\n640\t    gap_matrix:\n641\t      Lethe: adaptive method; no compound×phase analysis\n642\t      SparK: compound but uniform; no phase modulation\n643\t      ThinKV: single-axis phase-aware; no compound interaction\n644\t      Physics_of_KV: compression-rate phase transition (different 'phase' semantics)\n645\t      HIES: single-axis score collapse; no compound amplification\n646\t      R-KV: task-specific optimization; not mechanistic analysis\n647\t  result_rationale: \"C9 是 writing task。在 best tier 下 positioning 清晰无争议——没有 prior work\\\n648\t    \\ 同时\\n分析三个维度。关键区分：our \\\"phase\\\" = reasoning phase（temporal），Physics of KV \\n\\\"\\\n649\t    phase\\\" = compression-rate critical point（parametric）——语义正交。\\nHIES 的 score collapse\\\n650\t    \\ 发现反而是 supporting evidence，不是 prior art。\\n\"\n651\t  tables: []\n652\t  figures_description: []\n653\t  analysis: §2 通过 6 篇工作的精确区分完成 novelty positioning。无需额外实验。\n654\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b2bc5c33-59bf-4c89-8347-ed0dbc0c532c","uuid":"06a0a2ec-6378-4ef9-ae40-faba5859fe4b","timestamp":"2026-05-16T15:41:20.043Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T150210/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: \"原始 framing \\\"phase-gated compound sparsity\\\" 完全成立。Strategy ×\\\n  \\ phase × compound 三维交互\\n在三模型（DS/QW/LLaMA）、两架构（Qwen2/Llama）、三 benchmark（MATH-500/GSM8K/GPQA）上一致复现。\\n\\\n  LLaMA n=250 高功效下 imp_vs_rand d_z 达中等效应量（~0.52 at s030），random phase gradient 收缩至\\n\\\n  不显著（d_z~0.18），消除 n=50 的 architecture-dependent 限定。GPQA 提供跨推理领域（科学→数学）泛化，\\nstrategy\\\n  \\ specificity ratio ≥5× 确认 importance 的 phase-dependent compound interaction \\n\\\n  不是 metric artifact 而是 genuine phenomenon。C8 升级为 confirmed，论文 claims 无需调整。\\nTitle/framing\\\n  \\ 保持 \\\"phase-gated\\\"，EMNLP main 正会强竞争力——novelty 同时具备现象发现（三维交互）\\n和机制解释（discrimination\\\n  \\ collapse），泛化证据覆盖模型/架构/任务三个维度。\\n\"\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: LLaMA n=250 Cross-Architecture Full Validation\n  plan_id: c8_llama_n250_fixed\n  description: 'DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B 上 n=250 problems，8 条件（importance/random\n    × s015/s020/s025/s030）。\n\n    关键验证：(1) imp_vs_rand d_z 达 medium effect；(2) 3+ sparsity Bonferroni 显著；\n\n    (3) random phase gradient 在 n=250 下衰减至 negligible。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B\n    n_problems: 250\n    n_valid: 244\n    n_skipped: 6\n    conditions_completed: 8/8\n    n_bootstrap: 10000\n    bonferroni_k: 4\n    imp_vs_rand_dz:\n      s015: 0.25\n      s020: 0.34\n      s025: 0.44\n      s030: 0.52\n    imp_vs_rand_dz_ci:\n      s015:\n      - 0.08\n      - 0.42\n      s020:\n      - 0.17\n      - 0.51\n      s025:\n      - 0.27\n      - 0.61\n      s030:\n      - 0.35\n      - 0.69\n    imp_vs_rand_dz_interpretation:\n      s015: small\n      s020: small_to_medium\n      s025: medium\n      s030: medium\n    imp_vs_rand_dz_monotonic: true\n    phase_gradient_importance_dz:\n      s015: 0.95\n      s020: 1.04\n      s025: 1.12\n      s030: 0.98\n    phase_gradient_importance_dz_ci:\n      s015:\n      - 0.75\n      - 1.15\n      s020:\n      - 0.86\n      - 1.22\n      s025:\n      - 0.94\n      - 1.3\n      s030:\n      - 0.82\n      - 1.14\n    phase_gradient_importance_interpretation: all_large\n    phase_gradient_random_dz:\n      s015: 0.14\n      s020: 0.17\n      s025: 0.2\n      s030: 0.22\n    phase_gradient_random_dz_ci:\n      s015:\n      - -0.03\n      - 0.31\n      s020:\n      - 0.0\n      - 0.34\n      s025:\n      - 0.03\n      - 0.37\n      s030:\n      - 0.05\n      - 0.39\n    phase_gradient_random_interpretation: negligible_to_small\n    phase_gradient_random_bonferroni_significant:\n      s015: false\n      s020: false\n      s025: false\n      s030: false\n    median_diff:\n      s015: 0.024\n      s020: 0.055\n      s025: 0.152\n      s030: 0.42\n    median_diff_ci:\n      s015:\n      - 0.007\n      - 0.044\n      s020:\n      - 0.015\n      - 0.112\n      s025:\n      - 0.058\n      - 0.285\n      s030:\n      - 0.19\n      - 0.63\n    wilcoxon_p:\n      s015: 0.015\n      s020: 0.003\n      s025: 0.00028\n      s030: 1.5e-05\n    wilcoxon_p_bonferroni:\n      s015: 0.06\n      s020: 0.012\n      s025: 0.0011\n      s030: 6.0e-05\n    significant_bonferroni:\n      s015: false\n      s020: true\n      s025: true\n      s030: true\n    bonferroni_significant_count: 3\n    cross_arch_comparison:\n      deepseek_qwen2_imp_vs_rand_dz_s030: 0.8\n      llama_imp_vs_rand_dz_s030: 0.52\n      delta: 0.28\n      note: LLaMA effect weaker in magnitude but unambiguously medium (CI excludes\n        zero). Architecture modulates strength but not direction.\n  result_rationale: \"n=50 时 imp_vs_rand d_z=0.19→0.34，CI 极宽（s030: [0.06, 0.66]），仅\\\n    \\ s030 Bonferroni \\n显著（p=0.029）。n=250 使 SE 缩小 √5≈2.24 倍，效应量估计趋于真值。三个关键机制：\\n\\n\\\n    (1) Random phase gradient 衰减：n=50 时 random d_z=0.35-0.44 可能被采样变异性膨胀。\\nRandom masking\\\n    \\ 是无差别噪声注入，不应产生与 importance 同等的 strategy-dependent phase 调制。\\n在 n=250 下采样噪声被平滑，random\\\n    \\ d_z 回落至 ~0.14-0.22，无一 Bonferroni 显著——\\n与 DS/QW 在 n=500 下 random s015/s020 NS\\\n    \\ 的模式一致。n=50 时 LLaMA random 显著\\n很可能是 Type I error（多重比较 + 小样本变异性）。\\n\\n(2) Importance\\\n    \\ gradient 稳定：c8_llama_gpu0_s025 已验证 n=250 importance s025 \\nd_z=1.1174（与 n=50\\\n    \\ 的 1.12 一致），确认 importance phase gradient 是 robust signal \\n而非偶然。全 4 水平 d_z 维持在\\\n    \\ 0.95-1.12（large effect）。\\n\\n(3) imp_vs_rand 提升：当 random gradient 从 ~0.44 缩至\\\n    \\ ~0.22 而 importance 保持 ~1.0+，\\n两者差距扩大→imp_vs_rand d_z 从 0.34 提升至 0.52。s020/s025/s030\\\n    \\ 三水平获得\\nBonferroni 显著性（n=250 给出 >90% power 检测 d_z≥0.35 的效应）。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - name: LLaMA n=250 vs n=50 Effect Size Comparison\n    columns:\n    - sparsity\n    - n50_imp_rand_dz\n    - n250_imp_rand_dz\n    - n250_bonf_p\n    - significant\n    rows:\n    - - s015\n      - 0.19\n      - 0.25\n      - 0.06\n      - NS\n    - - s020\n      - 0.26\n      - 0.34\n      - 0.012\n      - ✓\n    - - s025\n      - 0.29\n      - 0.44\n      - 0.0011\n      - ✓\n    - - s030\n      - 0.34\n      - 0.52\n      - 6.0e-05\n      - ✓\n  - name: Random Phase Gradient Attenuation n=50 → n=250\n    columns:\n    - sparsity\n    - n50_random_dz\n    - n250_random_dz\n    - n250_CI_contains_zero\n    - bonf_significant\n    rows:\n    - - s015\n      - 0.35\n      - 0.14\n      - 'yes'\n      - 'no'\n    - - s020\n      - 0.37\n      - 0.17\n      - borderline\n      - 'no'\n    - - s025\n      - 0.45\n      - 0.2\n      - 'no'\n      - 'no'\n    - - s030\n      - 0.44\n      - 0.22\n      - 'no'\n      - 'no'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'fig_c8_n250_forest.pdf: Forest plot 三架构 (DS-Qwen2/QW/LLaMA) × 4 sparsity 的 imp_vs_rand\n    d_z 及 95% CI。LLaMA n=250 点位从 n=50 虚线位置移至 medium zone。'\n  - 'fig_c8_random_attenuation.pdf: 左=importance dz (稳定 ~1.0)，右=random dz (从 0.35-0.44\n    衰减至 0.14-0.22)，双 panel 对比 n=50 vs n=250。'\n  analysis: \"LLaMA n=250 解除 C8 的 architecture-dependent 限定。三个关键变化：\\n(1) imp_vs_rand\\\n    \\ d_z s030=0.52（medium），s020/s025/s030 Bonferroni 显著（3/4）；\\n(2) random phase gradient\\\n    \\ 全部无 Bonferroni 显著——与 DS/QW 模式一致；\\n(3) importance gradient 稳定（d_z=0.95-1.12），与\\\n    \\ c8_llama_gpu0_s025 已验证的 1.1174 吻合。\\n论文可改为 \\\"Cross-architecture validation confirms\\\n    \\ strategy×phase interaction \\n(d_z=0.52, Bonferroni p<0.001 at s=0.30)\\\" 而非 \\\"\\\n    suggests/provides partial support\\\"。\\nC8 从 partially_confirmed 升级为 confirmed。\\n\"\n- name: GPQA DeepSeek Importance Phase Gradient Profiling\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s015\n  description: 'DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 对 GPQA-Diamond (n=50) 运行 importance masking，\n\n    4 sparsity levels (s015/s020/s025/s030)。验证 phase gradient 单调递增跨 benchmark。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\n    benchmark: GPQA-Diamond\n    n_problems: 50\n    method: median + Wilcoxon + bootstrap_median(B=10000)\n    importance:\n      s015:\n        median_gradient: 0.19\n        ci_low: 0.065\n        ci_high: 0.39\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0006\n        bonferroni_p: 0.0024\n      s020:\n        median_gradient: 0.58\n        ci_low: 0.24\n        ci_high: 0.95\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0002\n        bonferroni_p: 0.0008\n      s025:\n        median_gradient: 1.72\n        ci_low: 0.82\n        ci_high: 2.55\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n        bonferroni_p: 0.0004\n      s030:\n        median_gradient: 4.15\n        ci_low: 1.9\n        ci_high: 8.9\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n        bonferroni_p: 0.0004\n    dose_response_monotonic: true\n    spearman_rho: 1.0\n    bonferroni_sig_count: 4\n    all_bonferroni_significant: true\n  result_rationale: \"GPQA-Diamond 是 graduate-level 科学推理，推理链结构介于 MATH-500（长复杂链）和 \\n\\\n    GSM8K（短规律链）之间。预测 phase gradient 单调递增：\\n\\n(1) 物理机制不依赖 task 类型——head pruning → discrimination\\\n    \\ collapse → compound interaction \\n在 low-sparsity phase 最严重，此机制跨 benchmark 通用。MATH-500\\\n    \\ 和 GSM8K 已 100% 单调。\\n\\n(2) Gradient magnitude 预计介于 MATH-500 (0.39→8.48) 和 GSM8K\\\n    \\ (0.24→4.68) 之间：\\nGPQA 多选题 format 使 reasoning chain 比 MATH-500 短（平均 token 更少），但科学推理\\n\\\n    的知识检索步骤比 GSM8K 算术多，compound sensitivity 居中。预测 s030 ≈ 4.15。\\n\\n(3) 全 4 水平 Bonferroni\\\n    \\ 显著——DS 在 MATH-500 n=50 时 s015 就显著 (d=0.61)，\\nGPQA 虽然绝对 magnitude 略小但效应仍在 detectable\\\n    \\ 范围，n=50 配合 DS 的强 signal 足够。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - name: Cross-Benchmark Phase Gradient (DeepSeek Importance)\n    columns:\n    - sparsity\n    - MATH-500_n500\n    - GSM8K_n50\n    - GPQA_n50\n    rows:\n    - - s015\n      - 0.39\n      - 0.241\n      - 0.19\n    - - s020\n      - 1.21\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.58\n    - - s025\n      - 3.99\n      - 1.992\n      - 1.72\n    - - s030\n      - 8.48\n      - 4.682\n      - 4.15\n  figures_description:\n  - 'fig_cross_benchmark_ds.pdf: 三条 dose-response 曲线 (MATH/GSM/GPQA) 均单调递增，GPQA 居中。'\n  analysis: 'DS GPQA gradient 0.19→4.15 单调递增（ρ=1.0），全 4 水平 Bonferroni 显著。\n\n    三 benchmark 全部单调复现，phase modulation 是跨推理领域的 robust finding。\n\n    Magnitude ordering MATH > GPQA > GSM 反映推理链复杂度对 compound sensitivity 的调制。\n\n    '\n- name: GPQA Qwen Importance Phase Gradient Cross-Model\n  plan_id: gpqa_profiling_qw\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct 对 GPQA-Diamond (n=50) importance masking，验证 cross-model\n    复现。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    model: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n    benchmark: GPQA-Diamond\n    n_problems: 50\n    importance:\n      s015:\n        median_gradient: 0.038\n        ci_low: 0.005\n        ci_high: 0.088\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.018\n        bonferroni_p: 0.072\n      s020:\n        median_gradient: 0.19\n        ci_low: 0.075\n        ci_high: 0.35\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0004\n        bonferroni_p: 0.0016\n      s025:\n        median_gradient: 0.85\n        ci_low: 0.42\n        ci_high: 1.3\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n        bonferroni_p: 0.0004\n      s030:\n        median_gradient: 2.28\n        ci_low: 1.22\n        ci_high: 3.55\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n        bonferroni_p: 0.0004\n    dose_response_monotonic: true\n    spearman_rho: 1.0\n    bonferroni_sig_count: 3\n    qw_ds_ratio_s030: 0.55\n    note: QW magnitude ~55% of DS, consistent with MATH-500 pattern (QW ~37%). GPQA\n      ratio slightly higher because QW's science reasoning less disadvantaged than\n      math.\n  result_rationale: 'QW 在 MATH-500 上 gradient 为 0.066→3.155（DS 的 ~37%），在 GSM8K 上为\n    0.039→2.092。\n\n    GPQA 预测 QW gradient 0.038→2.28，DS/QW 比值约 1.8×。\n\n\n    QW magnitude 一贯小于 DS（Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct 的 attention head utilization 更均匀，\n\n    pruning 影响较分散），但方向和单调性完全一致。s015 Bonferroni 边缘不显著（p=0.072），\n\n    与 MATH-500 上 QW s015 CI 含零的 onset threshold 模式一致——QW 在最低 sparsity 效应弱，\n\n    但 s020+ 稳定显著。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Cross-Benchmark Phase Gradient (Qwen Importance)\n    columns:\n    - sparsity\n    - MATH-500_n500\n    - GSM8K_n50\n    - GPQA_n50\n    rows:\n    - - s015\n      - 0.066\n      - 0.039\n      - 0.038\n    - - s020\n      - 0.307\n      - 0.158\n      - 0.19\n    - - s025\n      - 1.075\n      - 1.1\n      - 0.85\n    - - s030\n      - 3.155\n      - 2.092\n      - 2.28\n  figures_description:\n  - 'fig_cross_benchmark_qw.pdf: QW 三 benchmark gradient 曲线，标注 onset threshold ~s020。'\n  analysis: 'QW GPQA 单调递增复现（ρ=1.0），3/4 Bonferroni 显著。结合 DS，两模型×三 benchmark\n\n    共 6 条 dose-response 曲线全部单调。QW-GPQA s030=2.28 与 QW-GSM8K s030=2.09 接近，\n\n    暗示 QW 跨 task 的 compound sensitivity 较稳定。\n\n    '\n- name: GPQA Random Baselines and Strategy Specificity\n  plan_id: gpqa_random_baselines\n  description: 'DS 和 QW 对 GPQA-Diamond (n=50) 运行 random masking，计算 imp/rand ratio。\n\n    验证 strategy specificity ≥5×。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    ds_random:\n      s015:\n        median_gradient: 0.024\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.12\n      s020:\n        median_gradient: 0.072\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.045\n      s025:\n        median_gradient: 0.24\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.008\n      s030:\n        median_gradient: 0.55\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.003\n    qw_random:\n      s015:\n        median_gradient: 0.005\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.38\n      s020:\n        median_gradient: 0.025\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.15\n      s025:\n        median_gradient: 0.12\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.022\n      s030:\n        median_gradient: 0.36\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.006\n    strategy_specificity_ratio_ds:\n      s015: 7.9\n      s020: 8.1\n      s025: 7.2\n      s030: 7.5\n    strategy_specificity_ratio_qw:\n      s015: 7.6\n      s020: 7.6\n      s025: 7.1\n      s030: 6.3\n    strategy_specificity_ratio_range: 6.3-8.1×\n    all_ratios_above_5x: true\n    cross_benchmark_specificity:\n      MATH-500: 15-36×\n      GPQA: 6.3-8.1×\n      GSM8K: 2.3-3.8×\n  result_rationale: \"Strategy specificity ratio 的 task-dependence 与 reasoning chain\\\n    \\ 结构相关：\\n\\n(1) MATH-500 推理链最长最复杂（竞赛数学），importance score 的 phase-dependent \\ndiscrimination\\\n    \\ collapse 最剧烈 → ratio 最高（15-36×）；\\n\\n(2) GSM8K 推理链最短最规律（小学数学），importance 和 random\\\n    \\ 的差异被压缩 → \\nratio 最低（2.3-3.8×）；\\n\\n(3) GPQA 居中——graduate-level QA 涉及多步科学推理但为多选题\\\n    \\ format（答案段短），\\nreasoning 部分复杂度介于两者之间。ratio 6.3-8.1× 满足 ≥5× 的 best 阈值。\\n\\n物理解释：GPQA\\\n    \\ 的 scientific reasoning 涉及领域知识检索和逻辑链推理，importance \\nscore 对这些 pattern 的编码比 random\\\n    \\ 有明显优势（score collapse 使 importance 退化\\n但仍保留部分 phase-dependent 判别力），但不如 MATH-500\\\n    \\ 中长推理链的累积优势大。\\n\\nRandom baseline 在 GPQA s025+ 产生可测 compound effect（p<0.05），但\\\n    \\ magnitude \\n远小于 importance——与 DS/QW 在 MATH-500 n=500 上 random s025 显著但 ratio\\\n    \\ 15-38× \\n的模式定性一致。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - name: Strategy Specificity Ratio Across Benchmarks\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - ratio_range\n    - interpretation\n    - reasoning_chain_complexity\n    rows:\n    - - MATH-500\n      - 15-36×\n      - very_high\n      - 长复杂链（竞赛数学）\n    - - GPQA\n      - 6.3-8.1×\n      - high\n      - 中等链（科学推理多选）\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 2.3-3.8×\n      - moderate\n      - 短规律链（小学算术）\n  - name: GPQA imp/rand Ratio by Sparsity\n    columns:\n    - sparsity\n    - DS_imp\n    - DS_rand\n    - DS_ratio\n    - QW_imp\n    - QW_rand\n    - QW_ratio\n    rows:\n    - - s015\n      - 0.19\n      - 0.024\n      - 7.9\n      - 0.038\n      - 0.005\n      - 7.6\n    - - s020\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.072\n      - 8.1\n      - 0.19\n      - 0.025\n      - 7.6\n    - - s025\n      - 1.72\n      - 0.24\n      - 7.2\n      - 0.85\n      - 0.12\n      - 7.1\n    - - s030\n      - 4.15\n      - 0.55\n      - 7.5\n      - 2.28\n      - 0.36\n      - 6.3\n  figures_description:\n  - 'fig_gpqa_specificity.pdf: 双线图 DS/QW importance vs random gradient on GPQA，阴影面积标注\n    imp/rand ratio ≥5× zone。'\n  - 'fig_specificity_by_task.pdf: Bar chart 三 benchmark 的 mean ratio（MATH=25×, GPQA=7.4×,\n    GSM=3.0×），ordered by chain complexity。'\n  analysis: \"GPQA strategy specificity 6.3-8.1× 全部超过 5× 阈值，填补了 MATH (15-36×) 和 \\n\\\n    GSM (2.3-3.8×) 之间的 gap。三 benchmark 形成 interpretable gradient：推理链复杂度↑ \\n→ specificity\\\n    \\ ratio↑。这支持 \\\"discrimination collapse 是 mechanism\\\" 的 framing——\\n如果是 importance\\\n    \\ metric 本身有缺陷，ratio 不应随 task difficulty 系统性变化。\\nGPQA 数据使论文可以声明 \\\"strategy specificity\\\n    \\ is a robust phenomenon (≥5×) across \\ndiverse reasoning tasks\\\"。\\n\"\n- name: Discrimination Collapse Quantitative Prediction\n  plan_id: mechanism_gini_correlation\n  description: \"利用已完成的 c5_per_phase_gini 和 c2_n500 数据，计算 per-phase Gini_delta \\n与\\\n    \\ II severity 的跨模型定量相关。验证 Spearman ρ=1.0, Pearson r≥0.85。\\n\"\n  expected_results:\n    analysis_type: correlation of per-phase Gini collapse with II severity\n    data_source: c5_per_phase_gini (n=30/model) + c2_n500 (n=500/model)\n    ds_within_model:\n      gini_delta_low:\n      - -0.0163\n      - -0.0209\n      - -0.0313\n      - -0.0373\n      ii_median:\n      - 0.3907\n      - 1.2149\n      - 3.9857\n      - 8.4813\n      spearman_rho: -1.0\n      pearson_r: -0.94\n      pearson_p: 0.031\n    qw_within_model:\n      gini_delta_low:\n      - -0.0165\n      - -0.02\n      - -0.0286\n      - -0.035\n      ii_median:\n      - 0.0659\n      - 0.3073\n      - 1.0745\n      - 3.155\n      spearman_rho: -1.0\n      pearson_r: -0.96\n      pearson_p: 0.022\n    cross_model_pooled:\n      n_datapoints: 8\n      spearman_rho: -0.9\n      pearson_r: -0.86\n      pearson_p: 0.003\n    cv_correlation:\n      ds_cv_vs_ii_spearman: -1.0\n      qw_cv_vs_ii_spearman: -1.0\n      cross_model_cv_pearson: -0.88\n  result_rationale: \"Gini delta 和 II 的相关性有坚实的因果机制：head pruning → 剩余 head 的 importance\\\n    \\ \\nscore 分布更均匀（Gini 下降）→ importance-based eviction 丧失判别力 → eviction 近似\\n随机 →\\\n    \\ compound interaction 增大。因此 |Gini 下降| 应与 II severity 正相关。\\n\\n(1) DS low-phase\\\n    \\ Gini delta [-0.016→-0.037] 与 II [0.39→8.48] 完美单调共变\\n（Spearman ρ=-1.0 因为 Gini\\\n    \\ 是负值——更负=更大 collapse=更大 II）。\\nPearson r=-0.94 因两者均近似幂律增长但指数不同。\\n\\n(2) QW 同样单调（Gini\\\n    \\ [-0.017→-0.035]，II [0.066→3.155]），Pearson r 略高(-0.96)\\n因为 QW 的 II 增长在 log-scale\\\n    \\ 更接近线性。\\n\\n(3) 跨模型 pooling (8 points) r=-0.86——DS 和 QW 共享正趋势但斜率不同（DS 单位 \\nGini\\\n    \\ 下降对应更大 II 增加），反映 Gini→II 传递函数是 architecture-dependent 的，\\n但方向和 monotonicity\\\n    \\ 是 universal 的。\\n\\n数据已存在（c5_per_phase_gini + c2_n500），仅需分析脚本。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - name: Gini-II Correlation Summary\n    columns:\n    - scope\n    - Spearman_ρ\n    - Pearson_r\n    - p_value\n    rows:\n    - - DS within-model\n      - -1.0\n      - -0.94\n      - 0.031\n    - - QW within-model\n      - -1.0\n      - -0.96\n      - 0.022\n    - - Cross-model pooled (n=8)\n      - -0.9\n      - -0.86\n      - 0.003\n  figures_description:\n  - 'fig_gini_ii_scatter.pdf: |Gini_delta| vs II_median (log y-axis)，DS 圆/QW 方，按 sparsity\n    着色。回归线及 r² 标注。'\n  analysis: \"Within-model Spearman ρ=1.0（完美单调）排除了 \\\"Gini 下降但 II 不增加\\\" 的反例。\\nCross-model\\\n    \\ r=-0.86 (p=0.003) 远超 r≥0.7 阈值。论文 §5 可声明 \\\"Gini decline \\nquantitatively predicts\\\n    \\ interaction severity (cross-model r=0.86, p=0.003)\\\"，\\n将 discrimination collapse\\\n    \\ 从 qualitative hypothesis 提升至 quantitative predictor。\\n\"\n- name: 'C8 Status Upgrade: confirmed'\n  plan_id: c8_upgrade\n  description: '基于 c8_llama_n250_fixed 结果，将 C8 从 partially_confirmed 升级为 confirmed。\n\n    更新论文措辞和 claim table。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    c8_old_status: partially_confirmed\n    c8_new_status: confirmed\n    language_changes:\n      remove:\n      - suggests\n      - provides partial support\n      - architecture-dependent caveat\n      add:\n      - confirms strategy×phase interaction across architectures\n      - medium effect size (d_z=0.52)\n    limitation_retained: magnitude differs across architectures (LLaMA d_z=0.52 vs\n      Qwen2 d_z=0.80)\n    paper_abstract_update: can claim 'generalizes across architectures' without hedging\n  result_rationale: \"C8 升级的三个充分条件在 best tier 下全部满足：\\n(1) imp_vs_rand d_z ≥ 0.4 at\\\n    \\ s030 → ✓ (0.52, medium effect)\\n(2) ≥2 sparsity Bonferroni significant → ✓ (3/4\\\n    \\ 显著)\\n(3) random phase gradient 不再 Bonferroni significant → ✓ (0/4 显著)\\n\\nn=50\\\n    \\ 时的 \\\"architecture-dependent\\\" caveat 源于两个 anomaly：(a) imp_vs_rand 弱\\n(仅 s030\\\n    \\ p=0.029)；(b) random 也显示 phase gradient (d_z=0.35-0.44)。\\nn=250 同时解决了两者——(a)\\\n    \\ 3 水平显著，(b) random 衰减至 negligible。\\n这说明 n=50 的 anomaly 是统计功效不足 + 小样本变异性的产物，不是\\\n    \\ architecture \\n本身的差异。Strategy×phase interaction 是跨架构的 general phenomenon。\\n\"\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: \"C8 confirmed 使论文 claim table 全部为 confirmed（除 C5b future_work 和 C4 \\n\\\n    partially_confirmed）。核心贡献 \\\"strategy×phase interaction generalizes across \\narchitectures\\\"\\\n    \\ 无需 hedging，EMNLP reviewer 不能以 \\\"only works on one architecture\\\" \\ndismiss。\\n\"\n- name: C9 Related Work Gap Analysis\n  plan_id: c9_related_work\n  description: '§2 Related Work 写作——定位与 Lethe/SparK/ThinKV/Physics of KV/HIES/R-KV\n    的区分。\n\n    纯分析写作任务，无计算。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    output_type: manuscript_section\n    positioning: \"唯一同时分析 pruning × eviction compound interaction 如何随 reasoning phase\\\n      \\ \\n和 eviction strategy 变化的工作。三维 (compound × phase × strategy) 交互分析\\n是 unique\\\n      \\ contribution。\\n\"\n    gap_matrix:\n      Lethe: adaptive method; no compound×phase analysis\n      SparK: compound but uniform; no phase modulation\n      ThinKV: single-axis phase-aware; no compound interaction\n      Physics_of_KV: compression-rate phase transition (different 'phase' semantics)\n      HIES: single-axis score collapse; no compound amplification\n      R-KV: task-specific optimization; not mechanistic analysis\n  result_rationale: \"C9 是 writing task。在 best tier 下 positioning 清晰无争议——没有 prior work\\\n    \\ 同时\\n分析三个维度。关键区分：our \\\"phase\\\" = reasoning phase（temporal），Physics of KV \\n\\\"\\\n    phase\\\" = compression-rate critical point（parametric）——语义正交。\\nHIES 的 score collapse\\\n    \\ 发现反而是 supporting evidence，不是 prior art。\\n\"\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: §2 通过 6 篇工作的精确区分完成 novelty positioning。无需额外实验。\n","numLines":654,"startLine":1,"totalLines":654}}}
