a_n250, c10_lang_switching |\\\\n| D093 | 2026-05-16 | <think> phase validation 达标：adaptive κ=0.8804, AUC | c4_think_validation_math500 |\\\\n| D092 | 2026-05-16 | c9 power analysis 仅报告 random 条件；importance 条件丢弃 t- | c9_gsm8k_power_analysis |\\\\n| D091 | 2026-05-16 | R10 审稿 Weak Reject (2.25/5)：接受 Findings track，启动 5 | c3_llama, think_phase_validation, c4_entropy |\\\\n| D090 | 2026-05-16 | Round 10 dual dose curve 完成：DS 5-point (0.74→0.04) | acc_ds_dense_8k_v2, acc_ds_s015_8k_v2, acc_ds_s020_8k_v2, acc_ds_s025_8k_v2, acc_ds_s030_8k_v2, acc_qw_s030_b1_8k, acc_qw_s025_b1_8k |\\\\n| D089 | 2026-05-16 | DS 8k v2 揭示双 regime 结构：s≤0.20 截断驱动（非截断 acc ~71% 稳定 | acc_ds_dense_8k_v2, acc_ds_s015_8k_v2, acc_ds_s020_8k_v2, acc_ds_s025_8k_v2, acc_ds_s030_8k_v2 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4095, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01L3oMjxcWGpyyNSRHwEBtxY","session_id":"b2bc5c33-59bf-4c89-8347-ed0dbc0c532c","uuid":"1e6612a7-622d-40f7-92ff-a3d1b0588c35","timestamp":"2026-05-16T15:43:06.809Z"}
