{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XvwRubWeuaH6ojXQ66HVks","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-16\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| gpqa_ds_importance_s015 | Cross-task generalization: compound sparsity severity monotonically increases on GPQA Diamond (non-math reasoning) using quantile 3-segment phase decomposition (primary method). DS-R1 importance s015 as first condition. | — | — | — |\\\\n| c8_llama_n250_fixed | — | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- gpqa_ds_importance_s020（排队等待 GPU）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **c8_llama_gpu0_s025** (success): Pre-emptive run of LLaMA importance s025 on GPU 0 to accelerate c8_llama_n250_fixed (4-round serial → 3-round by pre-completing round 2 condition) ← 基于 c8_llama_n250_fixed\\\\n- **c10_lang_s020_s025** (success): —\\\\n- **c4_think_validation_math500** (success): —\\\\n  [c4_think_validation_math500](/api/workspace-files/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/c4_think_validation_math500/data/c4_think_validation_math500.txt)\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 65 / 负向 17 / 失败 17 / 共 129\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-22162: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp_interaction_index_profiling: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_ii_profiling_v4: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_ii_profiling_v4b: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_ii_profiling_v4c: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_ii_profiling_v4d: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_ii_profiling_v4-random: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_v4a_r2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_v4b_r2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_v4c_r2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_v4_legacy_s025: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_v4_legacy_s035: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_v4_float32_s030: 已被终止 — unknown\